icy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/10/23/agree-realty-adc-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ADC 2024 Q3","e":"adc","d":"2024-10-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Joel N. Agree","x":"We've increased the guidance to approximately 850, so you can deduce what we anticipate approximately in Q4.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/10/23/agree-realty-adc-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ADC 2024 Q4","e":"adc","d":"2025-02-12","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Joel N. Agree","x":"A couple of movie theaters we're always watching.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/12/agree-realty-adc-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ADC 2024 Q4","e":"adc","d":"2025-02-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joel N. Agree","x":"You combine it with rising construction costs and tariffs on aluminum and steel and all of these other things that are going to continue to challenge construction costs in this country, it's a tremendous solution and it continues to gain share, like you said.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/12/agree-realty-adc-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ADC 2024 Q4","e":"adc","d":"2025-02-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joel N. Agree","x":"Bill Ford came out and said these tariffs could destroy the auto industry.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/12/agree-realty-adc-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ADC 2024 Q4","e":"adc","d":"2025-02-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joel N. Agree","x":"Now if I'm a small middle market retailer, and I'm subject to those tariffs, and I don't have a multibillion-dollar balance sheet, I'm going to have to pass that through somehow or find some savings in SG&A. And so, it's -- look, tariffs will continue to be in the news, the impact of them.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/12/agree-realty-adc-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ADC 2025 Q2","e":"adc","d":"2025-08-01","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Joel N. Agree","x":"We continue to monitor the couple of movie theaters we have in the portfolio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/14/agree-realty-adc-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ADC 2025 Q2","e":"adc","d":"2025-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joel N. Agree","x":"I think the Big Beautiful Bill and what we're seeing going on in Washington ultimately is going to impact and tariffs are ultimately going to impact the smaller retailers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/14/agree-realty-adc-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ADC 2025 Q2","e":"adc","d":"2025-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joel N. Agree","x":"Smaller retailers that have to deal with tariff pass-throughs here, right, on goods that they're selling or components of the goods they're selling are going to be -- have to either take margin or pass on and price themselves out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/14/agree-realty-adc-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ADC 2025 Q2","e":"adc","d":"2025-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joel N. Agree","x":"But not dissimilar, the bigger retailers with the bigger balance sheets are going to be able to have choices and alternatives in terms of passing through incremental costs and inflationary cost to consumers due to tariffs or to eat margin or better negotiating leverage with their ultimate suppliers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/14/agree-realty-adc-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ADC 2025 Q4","e":"adc","d":"2026-02-11","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Joey Agree","x":"Tariffs don't help that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/11/agree-realty-adc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[35,1,6283,0,0,0,4811,1060],[36,1,6692,0,0,0,5349,1027],[37,1,550